                      "letterSpacing": 8
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "e6rsZ",
                      "name": "H",
                      "fill": "#16181A",
                      "content": "从山读起，随水而下",
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 38,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "yMkwF",
                      "name": "Hair",
                      "fill": "#BDB6A3",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "s4qhm",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3A3D38",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "临安在杭州之西，是山的临安。天目山系自皖南入境，迤逦向东，到杭州城边收住脚。天目是分水的山：北坡的溪流入苕溪，注入太湖；西坡的溪流入昌化溪，汇入钱塘江。山有多高，水就有多长。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IyA9p",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3A3D38",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "这一卷就从山读起。先从峰顶读起，读大树与云海；再下山，过源，过谷，入湖，到古镇的码头——水出山之后，就成了人间。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "bfpUJ",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3A3D38",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "一个叫钱镠的临安人，从这山水里走出去，把「临安」两个字，送进了千年的史书。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
