                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 8
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "EKFZ9",
                      "name": "H",
                      "fill": "#1F2A26",
                      "content": "从湖读起，向城而行",
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 38,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 4
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "d9wZe",
                      "name": "Hair",
                      "fill": "#C8BDA4",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N3sbJL",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3D4842",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "杭州是湖的杭州。西湖三面云山一面城，山不峻而秀，水不深而阔。湖是杭州的眉眼，也是杭州的尺度——城有多大，湖就有多静。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "hWq6m",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3D4842",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "这一卷就沿着湖读。先从湖本身读起，读苏堤白堤、读三潭印月；再读环湖的山、山中的茶园；然后向城而行：灵隐、西溪、运河、钱塘江、吴山；再读湖养出来的人间：龙井、丝绸、工艺、杭帮菜；最后读这座城的历史：良渚更早的城，吴越的奠基，南宋的偏安，卸下都城之后的人间。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Y59jfS",
                      "name": "P",
                      "fill": "#3D4842",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "这里不卖门票，不推线路。如果你读完，心里长出了一片湖、一座城，它就完成了使命。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 18,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
